      "source.description": {
        "zh-Hans": "Komiic 的繁中书库有《堀桑与宫村君》等日漫，作品同时有单话和单行本时会分别列出。原站有每日图片浏览额度。",
        "zh-Hant": "Komiic 的繁中書庫有《堀桑與宮村君》等日漫，作品同時有單話與單行本時會分開列出。本站設有每日圖片瀏覽額度。",
        "en": "Komiic is a Traditional Chinese catalogue with Japanese titles such as Hori-san to Miyamura-kun. Chapters and collected volumes have separate listings when both exist. The site has a daily image allowance."
      },
